   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NSU Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NSU Utv&#xE4;rdering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will evaluate the support to NSU over the years 1997-2002 totalling 8 675 300 SEK. A consultant will be called off framework agreement &#xD6;st 133/01 for the evaluation. TOR for the evaluation is enclosed. The evaluation will be conducted during spring 2002 to a total cost of 139 000 SEK.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige har st&#xF6;ttNSU i Bosnien 1997-2002 till en total kostnad om 8 675 300 kronor.EVB &#xE4;mnar forts&#xE4;tta st&#xF6;det, men vill g&#xF6;ra en ordentlig utv&#xE4;rdering av insatserna hittills som ett avstamp inf&#xF6;r det fortsatta arbetet. F&#xF6;r detta &#xE4;ndam&#xE5;l avropas en utv&#xE4;rderingskonsult fr&#xE5;n ramavtalet &#xD6;st 133/01 med Langbakk Consulting. Utv&#xE4;rderingen genomf&#xF6;rs v&#xE5;ren 2002 till en kostnad om 139 000 kr.</narrative>
  </description>
